  "idea": "Zapier transfer tool for bulk migrating legacy spreadsheet data",
  "text": "Stop spending hours manually formatting and cleaning old customer contact lists. Migrating historical spreadsheet data usually turns into a tedious nightmare of matching headers and fixing phone formatting. One mismatched column during a CSV import can overwrite entire customer databases and scramble purchase histories. Use Zapier Transfer to bulk filter, map, and import legacy rows directly into Airtable without running repetitive triggers. You complete months of data cleanup in minutes.",
